# src/main/resources/application.properties is tracked again. It was excluded
# because it carried a real signing key; it now carries none - every secret
# comes from the environment (JWT_SECRET, SPRING_DATASOURCE_*), and the
# fallbacks are development values the application refuses to deploy on. While
# it was excluded a fresh clone had no configuration at all, so nothing could
# be built and deployed from this repository.
